            "review_title": "Review at Gogi House",
            "review_text": "angusstevens0n\nMelbourne, Australia2 contributions\n0\nNice Food, Pleasant Atmosphere, Unfortunately Terrible Service and a Lying Security Guard\nSep 2018 • Friends\nI took my friends to the Truc Bach Gogi BBQ for a birthday celebration and though some of us felt a bit unwell after eating, on the surface i was impressed with the quality of the meat and the apparent cleanliness of the establishment, though the price was still quite high in comparison to competing restaurants. \nBut the 2 star rating is mainly related to the hesitance of the staff in providing the promised buffets, the quick cut off times and notably a security guard who lied to us about having to pay for parking when no other locals had to do so.\nMaybe we were just unlucky to meet such people, I hope that others have a better experience than we did.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 8, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
